SCENE Scene1

ENTITY Player
COMPONENT Transform 300 200 0 6 5
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 2
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas PlayerWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
ENTITYINIT Player

ENTITY Player3
COMPONENT Transform 300 000 0 6 5
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 2
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas PlayerWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
ENTITYINIT Player3

ENTITY Player4
COMPONENT Transform 300 -200 0 6 5
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 2
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas PlayerWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
ENTITYINIT Player4

ENTITY Player2
COMPONENT Transform -200 200 0 6 5
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 1
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas BlackWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
ENTITYINIT Player2

ENTITY Light
COMPONENT Transform 150 200 0 1 1
COMPONENT Light 0.5 0.5 0.5 1.0 500.0

ENTITY AmbientLight
COMPONENT Transform 0 0 0 0 0
COMPONENT Ambient 0.2 0.2 0.2 1.0
